  "ingredients": [
    "1.3333333730698 cups white sugar",
    "6 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "1 (14.1 ounce) package double-crust pie pastry, thawed",
    "4 cups chopped rhubarb",
    "1 tablespoon butter"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients, and preheat the oven to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C). Place an oven rack in the lowest position.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZAunsm_pK-Or7XSkkrC7aicKRYk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12316-fresh-rhubarb-pie-DDMFS-022-ingredient-c3e52384fe2144ccb36162856f259339.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12316/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Line the bottom and sides of a 9-inch pie plate with one pie crust. Combine sugar and flour in a small bowl; sprinkle 1/4 of the sugar mixture over the prepared bottom crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Px6NlNhpzvkO91SXjKSTeN26koI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12316-fresh-rhubarb-pie-DDMFS-025-step2-2b68b5af6fc5486fae179116bbbaa299.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12316/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heap chopped rhubarb on top and sprinkle with remaining sugar mixture. Dot with butter and cover with top crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NA4GrQOaAngtQLGDjibrlmzpvnk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12316-fresh-rhubarb-pie-DDMFS-027-step4-be80cd5a24f6429db9d10e2d7bd9ffca.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12316/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake pie in the preheated oven for 15 minutes. Reduce temperature to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C) and continue baking until filling is bubbly and crust is golden brown, about 40 to 45 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BzxIqchqQBwysiC_m3x4yFebi6c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12316-fresh-rhubarb-pie-DDMFS-031-step8-d82ff770b5804c38a7640cd20475d743.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12316/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve the pie warm or cold. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/D5v4_VN2uXUP_WCadaR70sBbEso=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12316-fresh-rhubarb-pie-DDMFS-033-4x3-a439543410844e53b6563491dcb50d99.jpg"
